<TR>
    <TD valign="top">
    <B><FONT size="2">Q:</FONT></B></TD>
    <TD></TD>
    <TD valign="top">
    <B><FONT size="2">What is a REIT?</FONT></B></TD>
</TR>

<TR>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
</TR>

<TR><TD><FONT size="1">

</FONT></TD></TR>

<TR>
    <TD valign="top">
    <FONT size="2">A:
    </FONT></TD>
    <TD></TD>
    <TD valign="top">
    <FONT size="2">In general, a real estate investment trust (REIT)
