</FONT></DIV>

<P align="left">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
<FONT size="2">Many of our properties will be leased to tenants
in the chain or franchise retail industry, including but not
limited to convenience stores, drug stores and restaurant
properties. Our advisor intends to monitor industry trends and
invest in properties that serve to provide the most favorable
return balanced with risk. Our management will target primarily
retail businesses with established track records. Because this
