<B><FONT size="2">Taxation of the Company</FONT></B>

<P align="left">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
<FONT size="2">We plan to make an election to be taxed as a REIT
under Sections&nbsp;856 through 860 of the Internal Revenue
