<P align="left">
<B><FONT size="2">Plan Assets&nbsp;&#151; Definition</FONT></B>

<P align="left">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
<FONT size="2">Neither ERISA nor the Internal Revenue Code
contains a definition of Plan Assets. A Department of Labor
regulation, referred to in this discussion as the Plan Asset
Regulation, provides guidelines as to whether, and under what
